        "Context & Synthesis: User_data fetches email bodies from Database (:8030) -> SQLite; MCP synthesizes grounded answer via Ollama / OpenAI tools"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Single-Writer Architecture & Resilience",
      "items": [
        "Single-Writer: Database (:8030) sole owner of SQLite; Accounts (:8010) owns tokens; Vector DB (:8040) owns Chroma store",
        "Mesh Security: Only Gateway binds 0.0.0.0; 5 backend services bind 127.0.0.1; Go Sync has Python fallback; Go Rate Limiter fails open"
